DUAL LICENCE
============

This repository is released under two licences.

1. CODE — Apache License 2.0
   Full text: LICENSE-CODE

   Applies to:
   - pipeline/scripts/                    (evaluation, ablation and data-preparation scripts)
   - pipeline/training/experiments/specs/ (training specifications)
   - .github/workflows/                   (continuous-integration configuration)
   - requirements.txt, .env.example

2. RESEARCH CONTENT — Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
   International (CC BY-NC 4.0)
   Full text: LICENSE-RESEARCH

   Applies to:
   - pipeline/annotation/                 (annotation guidelines)
   - pipeline/training/sonnet/gold-standoff.parquet and
     pipeline/training/haiku/gold-standoff.parquet (the stand-off gold annotations)
   - pipeline/labels-public/              (teacher predictions on the gold set)
   - pipeline/output-sample/              (sample of the per-posting output of the Spark run)
   - README.md and the other documentation

The trained models published on the Hugging Face Hub under AchrafSoltani/* are
released under CC BY-NC 4.0; each model card carries its base model's notice.

POSTING TEXT
============

No posting text is distributed here. The postings come from the Kaggle release
asaniczka/1-3m-linkedin-jobs-and-skills-2024 and remain under its terms. The
stand-off annotations and the teacher predictions record each entity's span
string and character offsets into that text.

